Error: bitlocker on driver:
Reason: when boot setting is changed, the driver may be locked
Solution:
    1. go to the BIOS, set the setting as before
    2. if do not remember the setting,
            go to MicroSoft to look for the bitlocker code, unlock the driver and it will goes fine
            Save current BIOS setting as custom setting, so that we only need to reset to custom setting in the future


